<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="referrer" content="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"><title>Invelle 管理登录</title><style>body{background:#f6f5ef;color:#263e33;font-family:system-ui;margin:0;padding:24px;display:grid;min-height:90vh;place-items:center}.card{background:#fff;padding:32px;border-radius:20px;width:min(360px,80vw)}h1{font-size:26px}label{display:block;margin-top:20px}input,button{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;font:inherit;border:1px solid #cbd2cb}button{background:#365a49;color:white;margin-top:24px}.error{color:#a2342b}p{line-height:1.6}</style></head><body><main class="card"><p>此间 · INVELLE</p><h1>管理后台登录</h1><p>使用专用管理员账号。此入口不读取个人对话或日记。</p><form method="post" action="${formAction?html}"><input type="hidden" name="client_id" value="${clientId?html}"><input type="hidden" name="grant_type" value="authorization_code"><input type="hidden" name="TENANT-ID" value="${tenantId?c}"><input type="hidden" name="zenflow_csrf" value="${csrf?html}"><label for="username">管理员账号</label><input id="username" name="username" autocomplete="username" required><label for="password">密码</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required><#if error??><p class="error">登录失败，请检查账号和密码。</p></#if><button type="submit">登录管理后台</button></form></main></body></html>
